<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">authorities strictly enforce environmental norms, and an expired PUC can lead to immediate impoundment or fines, disrupting your entire relocation schedule.</p>
